@startuml UC11_Receive_Warning_Notification_Activity_Diagram

title UC11: Receive Warning Notification - Activity Diagram

start
:Scheduler checks stored forecast data
for danger/warning flags by city and service;
:System identifies users who have both
that city and service in their preferences;

if (Matching users found?) then (yes)
  repeat
    :Select next user;
    :System retrieves user notification preferences;
    :System sends notification via configured channel
    (email/push);

    if (Notification delivered successfully?) then (yes)
      :User receives notification with warning details;
      :System logs notification delivery;
    else (no - delivery failed)
      :System retries using alternative channel;
    endif
  repeat while (More users to notify?) is (yes)
  ->no;
else (no matching users)
  :System logs event;
endif

stop

note right
  Multiple (city, service) pairs
  with danger flags for same user:
  System consolidates warnings
  into single notification
end note

@enduml
